abstract: >-
  Ω-Lab is a blind localization simulation and benchmarking environment
  with deterministic seeds, frozen benchmark conditions, comparator
  methods, null calibration, local CSV spectrum analysis, and an
  exportable audit ledger.
keywords:
  - "Ayala Ω Framework"
  - "blind localization"
  - "simulation"
  - "benchmarking"
  - "reproducibility"
  - "Monte Carlo"
  - "falsification"
